# ARGUS

Adaptive Graph Intelligence &
Anomaly Detection System

ARGUS is a local-first AI/ML intelligence
platform designed to discover behavioral
anomalies, hidden relationships, communities,
and temporal changes inside a continuously
evolving synthetic environment.

## Core Capabilities

- Real-time simulation
- Behavioral anomaly detection
- Isolation Forest
- Local Outlier Factor
- Ensemble detection
- K-Means clustering
- DBSCAN
- Graph intelligence
- Community detection
- Centrality analysis
- Link prediction
- Temporal change detection
- Live WebSocket monitoring
- Interactive graph visualization
- ML evaluation
- Scenario-based experimentation

## Architecture

Simulation
→ Feature Engineering
→ ML
→ Graph Intelligence
→ Analytics
→ FastAPI
→ React

## Cost

ARGUS is designed to operate without
paid AI APIs or external inference keys.

## Stack

Python
FastAPI
Scikit-learn
NetworkX
Pandas
NumPy
